# Which app fastlane is talking to. The bundle id is a build variable, never a
# committed literal: the listing's identifier is a fact about a deployment, not
# about the code. app.config.js reads the same APP_BUNDLE_ID with the same
# development fallback, and `make store-preflight` and tests/identity_test.ts
# fail if the two drift.
app_identifier(ENV["APP_BUNDLE_ID"] || "dev.local.scandinavianflick")

# The team is a personal detail, so it comes from the environment too
# (native/.env, gitignored; see native/.env.example). Authentication is the
# App Store Connect API key the Fastfile loads — never an Apple ID password.
team_id(ENV["APPLE_TEAM_ID"]) if ENV["APPLE_TEAM_ID"]
